</span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak B\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=|\\mathfrak B|\">\\(B=|\\mathfrak B|\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"71ede582cb78a069\" href=\"?note=71ede582cb78a069\" title=\"17-df-elementary-substructure\">17-df-elementary-substructure</a>；包含映射使用该依赖中定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_{\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B}\">\\(\\iota_{\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(A)\\)</span> 与赋值更新见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9b641c11eab6e875\" href=\"?note=9b641c11eab6e875\" title=\"17-df-assignment\">17-df-assignment</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathfrak A\\preceq_L\\mathfrak B\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(A)\\;\n\\bigl[&amp;\\exists b\\in B\\;\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak B,(\\iota_{\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B}\\circ s)[b/x],\\varphi)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak B,(\\iota_{\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B}\\circ s)[a/x],\\varphi)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathfrak A\\preceq_L\\mathfrak B\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(A)\\;\n\\bigl[&amp;\\exists b\\in B\\;\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak B,(\\iota_{\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B}\\circ s)[b/x],\\varphi)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak B,(\\iota_{\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B}\\circ s)[a/x],\\varphi)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Proposition 3.1.2，印刷 p.137。必要性来自初等性：若大结构满足存在式，小结构也满足，并提供见证。充分性对公式归纳：原子步由子结构的解释限制成立，布尔步直接；存在量词从大结构到小结构的方向用此见证条件，反方向用归纳假设。形式断言使用任意公式的见证条件，区别于仅对无量词矩阵检验的模型完全性 Robinson 判据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"71ede582cb78a069","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"9b641c11eab6e875","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"ec1305482f8eec2e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"71ede582cb78a069","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak B$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$，见 [[17-df-elementary-substructure]]；包含映射使用该依赖中定义的 $\\iota_{\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B}$。$\\mathrm{Assign}(A)$ 与赋值更新见 [[17-df-assignment]]；$\\mathrm{Sat}_L$、$\\mathrm{Form}_L$ 见 [[17-df-satisfaction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"9b641c11eab6e875","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak B$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$，见 [[17-df-elementary-substructure]]；包含映射使用该依赖中定义的 $\\iota_{\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B}$。$\\mathrm{Assign}(A)$ 与赋值更新见 [[17-df-assignment]]；$\\mathrm{Sat}_L$、$\\mathrm{Form}_L$ 见 [[17-df-satisfaction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"ec1305482f8eec2e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak B$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$，见 [[17-df-elementary-substructure]]；包含映射使用该依赖中定义的 $\\iota_{\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B}$。$\\mathrm{Assign}(A)$ 与赋值更新见 [[17-df-assignment]]；$\\mathrm{Sat}_L$、$\\mathrm{Form}_L$ 见 [[17-df-satisfaction]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak B","display":false},{"tex":"A=|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"B=|\\mathfrak B|","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_{\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sat}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Form}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathfrak A\\preceq_L\\mathfrak B\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\quad\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(A)\\;\n\\bigl[&\\exists b\\in B\\;\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak B,(\\iota_{\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B}\\circ s)[b/x],\\varphi)\\\\\n&\\to\\exists a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak B,(\\iota_{\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B}\\circ s)[a/x],\\varphi)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1820,"backlinks":[{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-229","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-thm-aleph-one-categoricity-consequences]]\n[[17-thm-atomic-model